# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Deploy-only repository (GitHub Pages project site:
#  https://tsuev.github.io/portfolio/).
#
#  main contains ONLY the prebuilt static site (out/) and the Pages
#  workflow (.github/). All Next.js source, configs and tooling live
#  elsewhere and must never be committed here — so instead of listing
#  exclusions we do the opposite: ignore EVERYTHING and re-include the
#  few things this repo is meant to hold.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*

# allowlist — the only content that belongs in this repo:
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
!/out/
!/out/**
